From 6204cfab1f8b9d4d77fe4e43ca2a7465d234f936 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Franke <christian.franke@t-online.de>
Date: Tue, 14 Oct 2025 14:12:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix null pointer dereference on unknown form factor value in
 FARM data

The issue was detected by Corgea.

Signed-off-by: Christian Franke <christian.franke@t-online.de>

https://github.com/smartmontools/smartmontools/commit/6204cfab1f8b9d4d77fe4e43ca2a7465d234f936

--- smartmontools-7.5/farmprint.cpp
+++ smartmontools-7.5/farmprint.cpp
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ static const char* farm_get_form_factor(const uint64_t formFactor) {
     case 0x5:
       return "< 1.8 inches";
     default :
-      return 0;
+      return "UNKNOWN";
   }
 }
 
